---
import PageShell from '../layouts/PageShell.astro'
---
<PageShell
    title="About the Jingle Jam Community Site"
    description="What the Jingle Jam Community site is: a fan-run hub for the Yogscast schedule, past streams with VODs, community fundraisers and streamer tools. Not official."
    canonical="https://jinglejam.ostof.dev/about"
>
    <div class="flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-white p-2">
        <h1 class="text-2xl">About the Jingle Jam Community Site</h1>
    </div>

    <p class="max-w-3xl text-white">
        jinglejam.ostof.dev is a site maintained by the community. You can see the
        <a class={'underline'} href={'/yogs'}>Yogscast Jingle Jam schedule</a> and past Yogscast Jingle Jam Streams
        including links to the VODs, <a class={'underline'} href={'/community'}>community fundraisers</a> and
        <a class={'underline'} href={'/stream-resources'}>resources for streamers</a>. Questions are answered in the
        <a class={'underline'} href={'/faq'}>FAQ</a>.{' '}
        <strong>
            For more information about the Jingle Jam visit{' '}
            <a class={'underline'} href={'https://jinglejam.co.uk'}>
                jinglejam.co.uk
            </a>
        </strong>
    </p>


</PageShell>
